== Summary ==
Blue-and-silver Original Virtual Set 1 symbol used on the Players Committee's December 2006 remastered slips. This file is a lossless WebP export of the shared CardMaker master, with its existing transparency and printed rim retained.

== Source ==
* Obtained from [https://github.com/billbisco/swccg-cardmaker/blob/ed271e5000117b80af36bd28e3987c5c34af3ec4/assets/icons/ovs-set-1.png CardMaker shared PNG master, assets/icons/ovs-set-1.png], commit <code>ed271e5000117b80af36bd28e3987c5c34af3ec4</code>. [https://raw.githubusercontent.com/billbisco/swccg-cardmaker/ed271e5000117b80af36bd28e3987c5c34af3ec4/assets/icons/ovs-set-1.png Download original PNG]. The master has the same RGB artwork as [[:File:VS1-Legacy-set-symbol.png]], whose existing source identifies the set-symbol crop on the cover of ''VirtualCards1.pdf''.
* Printed-symbol comparison: [https://web.archive.org/web/20071024153847/http://www.swccgpc.com/Resources/VirtualCards1.pdf#page=2 VirtualCards1.pdf, page 2, card 10], [[Players Committee]], official text as of 4 December 2006. The matching blue-and-silver symbol appears at the lower right of the [[Darth Vader (V) (Virtual Set 1) (Errata 2)|Darth Vader remastered slip]], [[:File:VS1O-10-Darth Vader.png|source image]], and the [[Luke Skywalker (V) (Virtual Set 1) (Errata 2)|Luke Skywalker remastered slip]], [[:File:VS1O-05-Luke Skywalker.png|source image]], on the same sheet, card 05. The cover's native image-object extraction has not been re-established by this export; the actual obtained-from source is the pinned shared PNG above.

== Transformation ==
312 × 312 RGBA PNG exported with Pillow lossless WebP, <code>lossless=True, exact=True, method=6</code>. The decoded WebP is exactly equal to all four source RGBA channels. No redraw, recoloring, new alpha mask or background cleanup was performed. The existing rim pixels are retained. Display at 20px in the infobox.

This symbol belongs to the 2006 remastered presentation. The earlier unnumbered slip, numbered 2002 circled-1 print options and Premium Edition have different printed marks.

SHA-256: <code>d450ddb87db722a6e1a0233dcbf2ab472b99df3182acbac1c278a05ea5151239</code>. Original PNG SHA-256: <code>dadf5c132cb302fc1a9088e4d100fb02f68e6001b26d870214bd5b67f853222f</code>.